75	81	react/jsx-no-constructed-context-values	defaultMsg	The object passed as the value prop to the Context provider (at line 1) changes every render, so every consumer of this context re-renders on every render of this component even when nothing it reads has changed. Wrap it in a useMemo hook so the identity is stable between renders.	0	0
